5d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Assault Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/953cfdeb2703978b1ab449b991b98989.png","desc":"This shotgun's magazine is optimized for quick combat.\n  •  Greatly increases stability\n  •  Increases rate of fire"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Strategist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/dc9057be28071222ed303d6baab3eb4f.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon generate class ability energy. Activating your class ability briefly improves this weapon's stability."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Invisible Hand","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a309822ed9a0f590a4a3279f9f0d89c4.png","desc":"Repeatedly missing targets increases this weapon's stability for a short time. This buff lasts for a short duration after a target is hit."},{"name":"Bottomless Grief","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/088930f7cf51b028acc8b7cb477fff9c.png","desc":"Increases magazine size. While you are the last living member of your fireteam, each final blow refills your magazine."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Voltshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a71ffb1cb221ea64fa77ab473f8a3a61.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target overcharges this weapon for a short period of time, causing it to jolt on its next hit."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e